AltoERC4626RatioLinearDiscountOracle::updateERC4626RatioNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when initialRatio is zero
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleERC4626RatioInvalidInput
    ├── when initialTimestamp is greater than block.timestamp
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleERC4626RatioInvalidInput
    ├── when maxYearlyGrowthRatioWad is zero
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleERC4626RatioInvalidInput
    └── when node is valid
        ├── it should replace the existing erc4626RatioNode
        ├── it should emit SetERC4626RatioNode with old and new node
        └── it should update erc4626RatioNode storage correctly
